gantt
    title Product launch plan
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %b %d
    excludes weekends

    section Design
    Requirements          :done,    req, 2026-01-05, 7d
    UX wireframes         :done,    ux,  after req, 8d
    Visual design         :active,  vis, after ux, 10d

    section Build
    Backend API           :crit,    api, 2026-01-19, 20d
    Mobile client         :         mob, after vis, 18d
    Integration           :         int, after api, 6d

    section Release
    Beta testing          :         beta, after int, 10d
    Fix critical bugs     :crit,    fix, after beta, 5d
    Launch                :milestone, after fix, 0d
